      "change": "Canonical schema decoding, explicit truncated-output/context-window failures, bounded repair output reservation, exact pinned alternate model identity and restricted local HTTP transport."
    },
    {
      "area": "jvm_repair",
      "change": "Use native JVM source validation and permit repository application/octet-stream metadata for text repair commands while retaining UTF-8 string, NUL, path and size checks."
    },
    {
